{"3184290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Interrogator 2", "steam_appid": 3184290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The small town of Repriev, in the remote state of East Dakota, is gripped by an unprecedented crime wave. Rumors speak of a self-proclaimed prophet manipulating events from the shadows. You, pathologist Frank, and officer Pulaski are sent to uncover the truth, joined by a new partner, Charles, a fellow interrogator. Together, you will question suspects, connect scattered clues, and investigate cases that slowly reveal the source of the town's collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every interrogation matters. Conversations shape investigations, testimonies contradict each other, and the truth must be extracted one word at a time. Newspapers, personal journals, and witness accounts gradually build a larger picture of what is really happening in Repriev.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184290/extras/343d996edb5cca5ef5af6181b024283b.poster.avif?t=1782487192\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184290/extras/343d996edb5cca5ef5af6181b024283b.webm?t=1782487192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184290/extras/343d996edb5cca5ef5af6181b024283b.mp4?t=1782487192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that the game features a small embedding model localized within game's files, not an advanced AI system like LLM/Llama/GPT. It runs locally, on your computer, game doesn't require any internet connection. If you're expecting an immersive AI experience, you <strong>will </strong>be disappointed. The Primary tool of input is either word of mouth or written text. Conversation is the main focus of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a humorous aspect to the game, intentional and otherwise. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The small town of Repriev, in the remote state of East Dakota, is gripped by an unprecedented crime wave. Rumors speak of a self-proclaimed prophet manipulating events from the shadows. You, pathologist Frank, and officer Pulaski are sent to uncover the truth, joined by a new partner, Charles, a fellow interrogator. Together, you will question suspects, connect scattered clues, and investigate cases that slowly reveal the source of the town's collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every interrogation matters. Conversations shape investigations, testimonies contradict each other, and the truth must be extracted one word at a time. Newspapers, personal journals, and witness accounts gradually build a larger picture of what is really happening in Repriev.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184290/extras/343d996edb5cca5ef5af6181b024283b.poster.avif?t=1782487192\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184290/extras/343d996edb5cca5ef5af6181b024283b.webm?t=1782487192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184290/extras/343d996edb5cca5ef5af6181b024283b.mp4?t=1782487192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that the game features a small embedding model localized within game's files, not an advanced AI system like LLM/Llama/GPT. It runs locally, on your computer, game doesn't require any internet connection. If you're expecting an immersive AI experience, you <strong>will </strong>be disappointed. The Primary tool of input is either word of mouth or written text. Conversation is the main focus of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a humorous aspect to the game, intentional and otherwise. </p>", "short_description": "Step into the role of a detective skilled in the art of interrogation, solving complex criminal cases through dialogue and deduction. Work alongside your partner Charles, question suspects, connect the dots, uncover lies, and shape each investigation to reveal the true nature of the crime wave.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184290/645897375c0a45018e4ffe75219a42ade56ffc51/header.jpg?t=1782487192", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184290/24088cb6ab6fd8f8775eb574d966f962bf581eab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782487192", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184290/24088cb6ab6fd8f8775eb574d966f962bf581eab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782487192", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel CPU Core i5-2500K 3.3GHz, AMD CPU Phenom II X4 940<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GPU GeForce GTX 1060, AMD GPU Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> If in doubt, try demo.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br><